    <statement><image xmlns:pi="http://pretextbook.org/2020/pretext/internal" pi:generated="webwork/images/points-on-plane-2-image-1.png" width="100%"/>
<p>In the graph above, the x and y values are shown on the axes.</p>
<p>Find the coordinates of each of the marked points.</p>
<p><input name="submitAnswers" onclick="document.getElementById('_panicked').value++" type="submit" value=" Ask for a Hint"/></p>
<p>The point with coordinates (4,-4) is <fillin characters="1" name="AnSwEr0001"/>.</p>
<p>The point with coordinates (5,4) is <fillin characters="1" name="AnSwEr0002"/>.</p>
<p>The point with coordinates (1,1) is <fillin characters="1" name="AnSwEr0003"/>.</p>
<p>The point with coordinates (1,-3) is <fillin characters="1" name="AnSwEr0004"/>.</p>
<p>The point with coordinates (2,3) is <fillin characters="1" name="AnSwEr0005"/>.</p>
<p>The point with coordinates (-1,-4) is <fillin characters="1" name="AnSwEr0006"/>.</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\text{F}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\text{C}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\text{B}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\text{D}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
